#. translators: %s: scan time estimate, for example "about 5 to 20 minutes"
#: admin/views/scan.php:171
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A scan usually takes %s, depending on the number of plugins, themes and PHP "
"files. It runs fastest with this page open."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/scan.php:182
msgid "Does the scan slow down my website for visitors?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/scan.php:186
msgid ""
"Visitors should not notice on most hosts. The scan works in short steps with "
"pauses between them (set by the scan pace in Settings), and each step uses "
"one PHP process while it runs. On small shared hosting, run it at a quiet "
"time."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/scan.php:193
msgid "Why did my scan pause or stop?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/scan.php:197
msgid ""
"If you paused it, press Resume. If background scanning is off and \"Pause "
"when tab is hidden\" is on, the scan pauses while this tab is hidden and "
"continues when you return; findings so far are kept."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/scan.php:198
msgid ""
"If the scan stops without finishing, a PHP timeout on the server may have "
"interrupted it. Lower Time per step in Settings, or run the scan at a quiet "
"time."
msgstr ""

