#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:220
msgid "wp-config-sample.php is publicly accessible"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:221
msgid ""
"The sample config file is readable via HTTP. While it contains no real "
"credentials it confirms WordPress is installed and reveals config structure "
"to attackers."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:222
msgid "Delete wp-config-sample.php from the server."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:228
msgid ".env file is publicly accessible"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:229
msgid ""
"A .env file responded with HTTP 200. These files typically contain database "
"credentials, API keys, and other secrets."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:230
msgid ""
"Move .env above the webroot or add a deny rule in your webserver config to "
"block access to .env files."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:235
msgid ".git/config is publicly accessible"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:236
msgid ""
"The git repository configuration is publicly readable. This exposes "
"repository metadata and may allow full source code download."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:237
msgid ""
"Block access to the .git directory at the webserver level (deny all .git "
"paths)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:242
msgid "WordPress debug.log is publicly accessible"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:243
msgid ""
"The debug.log file is readable via HTTP and may contain stack traces, file "
"paths, database errors, and user data."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:244
msgid ""
"Block access to debug.log via the webserver or move WP_DEBUG_LOG path "
"outside the webroot."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:249
msgid "phpinfo.php is publicly accessible"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:250
msgid ""
"A phpinfo() file was found. It discloses PHP configuration, loaded "
"extensions, environment variables, and server internals to any visitor."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:251
msgid "Delete phpinfo.php immediately."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:256
msgid "info.php is publicly accessible (possible phpinfo)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:257
msgid ""
"A PHP file at info.php was found. If it calls phpinfo(), it discloses "
"sensitive server configuration to any visitor."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:258
msgid "Delete or restrict info.php."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:285
msgid "WP-Cron is disabled — verify a real server cron is running"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:286
msgid ""
"DISABLE_WP_CRON is set (recommended for production). Ensure a system cron "
"job calls wp-cron.php on a schedule, otherwise scheduled tasks will not fire."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:287
msgid ""
"Example cron entry: */5 * * * * wget -q -O - https://yoursite.com/wp-"
"cron.php?doing_wp_cron >/dev/null 2>&1"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:292
msgid "WP-Cron fires on page load (default behaviour)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:293
msgid ""
"WP-Cron is triggered on every visitor request. On high-traffic or heavily-"
"attacked sites this wastes resources and can amplify the impact of a request "
"flood."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:294
msgid ""
"Add define( 'DISABLE_WP_CRON', true ); to wp-config.php and schedule a real "
"server cron job to call wp-cron.php every 5–15 minutes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:314
msgid "COOKIE_DOMAIN is set to an empty string"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:315
msgid ""
"Defining COOKIE_DOMAIN as '' removes the domain restriction from WordPress "
"auth cookies. This is sometimes intentional in multisite setups but widens "
"cookie scope unexpectedly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:316
msgid ""
"Set COOKIE_DOMAIN to your actual domain or remove the definition to use the "
"WordPress default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:327
msgid "Login URL is not HTTPS despite site using HTTPS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:328
msgid ""
"The wp_login_url() value does not begin with https://. Credentials can be "
"transmitted in plaintext."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:329
msgid ""
"Ensure home_url and site_url both use https://, and that FORCE_SSL_ADMIN is "
"set."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:353
msgid "Dangerous PHP functions are not disabled"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of PHP function names
#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:356
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The following PHP functions are callable: %s. If a plugin or theme has a "
"code injection bug, these can be used for OS command execution."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:359
msgid ""
"If no plugin on the site needs them, add to php.ini: disable_functions = "
"exec,passthru,shell_exec,system,proc_open,popen,pcntl_exec. This setting "
"only works in the server's main php.ini, so on shared hosting ask your host "
"to apply it. Test the site afterwards: some backup, image and update tools "
"use these functions."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:366
msgid "Dangerous PHP execution functions are all disabled"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-security-config.php:367
msgid ""
"exec, passthru, shell_exec, system, proc_open, popen, and pcntl_exec are "
"disabled via disable_functions."
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-ssl.php:39
msgid "SSL / TLS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/checks/class-shieldscope-check-ssl.php:111
